        { "id": "list-view-actions", "title": "Actions on items", "lead": "Use `ItemActions` for content at each item's end, such as a badge or an icon button named for its item, and `ItemMenu` for a ⋯ menu of `MenuItem`s, named \"Actions for\" and the item's label. Keep one or two actions visible and put the rest in the menu; a menu that renders nothing for an item leaves it without the button.",
