        { "id": "list-view-load-more", "title": "Load more", "lead": "Use `PageSize` with `DataPaging.LoadMore` for a button after the last item that adds the next page, and `MaxHeight` to scroll the items in the list's box, the button with them. Numbered pages and `DataPaging.NextPrevious` work as in Table. The page goes in the address, so `QueryPrefix` keeps two lists apart.",
