        { "id": "list-view-load-on-scroll", "title": "Loading on scroll", "lead": "Use `DataPaging.LoadOnScroll` with a `MaxHeight`: the next page loads as the last item scrolls into view. Its Load more button is for the keyboard, out of sight until it has focus.",
