        { "id": "list-view-save-order", "title": "Reordering, and saving the order", "lead": "Use `Reorderable`. On a static page give it a `Name` and pass the posted `ListOrder` back as `Order`; `Order.Arrange` puts the items in the posted order. On an interactive page, `@bind-Items` keeps the order.",
