        { "id": "list-view-drag-cards", "title": "Dragging the whole item", "lead": "Use `DragWholeItem` to let a drag start anywhere on an item, such as cards in `Columns`: with a mouse after a small move, on touch after a long press, so a swipe still scrolls the page. Links, buttons and fields in an item keep their presses. With an `ItemMenu` there are no handles: each item's ⋯ menu ends with Move, a submenu of the moves, and Alt+arrows work on the ⋯ button. Without one, the handle stays as the menu of moves.",
